Lishorrs Scenario
Difficulty : 6
Bonus : 60
--------------------------------------------------------------
To the South of your holdings lies a land of Fryhtans, enveloped and well protected by forests of the dreaded Lishorrs.
These Fryhtans and their floral horrors must not be allowed to survive, as it is their way to overrun and exterminate Mankind.
To destroy them in the five years that you are allotted it will most likely be necessary to invoke the aid of the God Baal-Hammon. 
